      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Kafka consumer group lag (total per group). Derived from Strimzi Kafka Exporter: topic partition end offset minus consumergroup current offset (exporter does not expose kafka_consumergroup_lag). Prometheus must scrape the exporter (deploy/monitoring/values.yaml). Lag rises on burst, falls as submitters scale.",
