      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 48 },
      "id": 106,
      "title": "Worker claimable queue & lag",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Kafka consumer group lag for the worker claimable queue (gpu.workloads.claimable). Computed from Strimzi Kafka Exporter as topic partition end offset minus consumergroup current offset for the gpu-scheduler-worker group. Lag rises when the scheduler admits work faster than workers can claim it.",
